"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5107020","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3183440","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:56Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3183440,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-3183440","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:56Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3183440,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3183440","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:56Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3183440,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1847286114035227","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"announcement","title":"Outwith Demo v0.2.20: Key rebinding fixes and enemy balance tweaks","summary":"Hi folks, Thanks to all the great feedback this week, here's a round-up of the latest fixes now live in the demo: Controls Rebinding a key that's already in use now swaps the two actions, instead of reverting to the default. Movement keys (W, A, S, D) can now be rebound properly. Custom key bindings now load correctly at startup, without needing to open the options menu first. Balance The Skeleton Soldier at the windmill now hits less hard and goes down a bit easier. It's still a challenge, but ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:02:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035227","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1847286114033217","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Outwith Demo v0.2.17: Hotfix for controller input in character creation","summary":"Hi folks, A quick hotfix for the demo: Fixed an issue where using the d-pad on a controller in the character creator could return control to the player, letting you move and attack while the creator was still on screen, and opening menus behind it. Fixed the same issue in a few other screens, including the rest dialogue, reading notes in the world and the notice board. A big thank you to the player who reported this. Feedback like this genuinely helps, so please keep it coming via the Steam disc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:34:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033217","verified_at":"2026-10-22T19:40:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1846651706694858","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Outwith Demo Update v0.2.16","summary":"Thanks to everyone who has already jumped into the demo. Every wishlist, playthrough and comment helps maintain my sanity. What's new in the latest demo Skill trees. The demo now has a full skill screen with trees for Warrior, Guardian, Mage, Hunter and more. You earn an ability point each time you level up. The demo caps at level 3, so you'll have a few points to spend on a handful of live perks, such as Brawler for fighting with your fists and Dual Wielding. The rest of each tree is visible bu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:26:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694858","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:45:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1846018067936809","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Outwith Demo Update v0.2.12","summary":"Hi folks, Just a quick update to mention the following fixes and improvements: Fixed the main menu load and continue buttons flashing visible when first viewing the start screen with no saved games. Tweaked enemy combat AI attack distances to reduce the chance of enemies attacking when out of range. Added a line-of-sight check to prevent enemies attacking through geometry. Added a run toggle and removed auto-run. I'm also currently working on the skill trees, rethinking and expanding the availab","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:07:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1845383656392897","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Alchemy, New UI, Deity and Origins","summary":"Hi folks, Alchemy has now been added to the demo! It didn't really make sense being able to collect alchemy materials without being able to use them, so I've polished up the alchemy system a little and turned it on. The alchemy bench can be found near the village blacksmith. I've also given the UI some polish and fixes — hopefully that makes the overall experience a little smoother. I've also added Deities and Origins to character creation. Their effects are now implemented too, and I'm hoping t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T08:59:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392897","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1844751498221975","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"UI polish & the next demo update","summary":"Hi folks, I've been spending some time this week finally polishing Outwith's UI. I had a rethink around the UX for the Inventory screen and moved a few things around. Hopefully this will help improve the experience. I've also updated the buttons and borders to something which I think is much more in keeping with Outwith. The new version of the demo which includes the latest UI changes should be out in the next few days. There's a few other changes and improvements coming along with it including ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T15:50:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221975","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1843481262702141","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Outwith Demo Update Now Live","summary":"Outwith Demo Update — Now Live A new update for the Outwith Demo is now live. This update adds a new side quest, expands character creation, improves combat and progression, and includes a number of changes aimed at making the world easier to navigate and more polished. What's New Three Sides of the Coin A new side quest beginning in the village. Expanded Character Creation New hair style options New hair colour options Deity selection added Origin selection added New character creation camera c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T15:57:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702141","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1843481262688508","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Almost Ready","summary":"Hi Folks,I'm currently finalising an update which I hope to launch at the beginning of next week.I've really enjoyed chatting with players and getting some amazing feedback. I really appreciate it, and I hope I can reciprocate by making the necessary improvements that will, over time, deliver a unique hand-crafted game worthy of players' time.The upcoming update includes several priority changes aimed at addressing some of the issues highlighted since the initial demo launch. Added a new side-qu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T09:25:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1842212951300071","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.6 - Minor Onboarding Fixes","summary":"Added notification when the player is heading towards the demo exitSmall onboarding text changesAdded extra weapon loot instancesAdjusted the starting quest trigger so that the player immediately see the starting quest notification","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T13:44:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1842212951299012","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.5 - Bug Fixes and Polish","summary":"Fixed another issue with lighting not resetting and staying too darkFixed road bandit encounter audioAdded polish to loading screensRestored previous Drifter dialogue","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T06:07:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951299012","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1842212951297438","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.4 - Onboarding Fixes","summary":"Improved visibility of points of interest, including camps, chests and other lootable objects.Fixed an issue where previously looted items could appear in the world even though they were empty.Added additional Drifter dialogue and reactions relating to starting equipment and spells.Additional voice acting for the Drifter will be added once the dialogue is finalised.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T16:11:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1841579228679235","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.3 - Minor Fixes & Quality of Life","summary":"Improvements & FixesFixed Heal spell icon and description.Fixed Ball of Fire spell icon.Improved lip-syncing.Updated skeleton death sound.Fixed dog bark audio.Added notifications for low Condition and Nourishment.Added small notifications when acquiring important items for the first time, such as bows and swords.Fixed arrow inventory display.Fixed controller support for the drop items UI.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T18:51:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228679235","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1841579228673026","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix v0.1.2","summary":"A small hotfix addressing a few issues identified during the demo:NPC Speech Volume - Adjusted NPC speech volume and audio settings to improve speech clarity.Lighting Adjustments - Made a number of lighting tweaks to improve visibility and consistency across the demo.Healing Improvements - Refined the Heal spell to make it clearer, more responsive, and more useful during combat.Survival Mechanics - Added and improved contextual cues to better communicate the game's survival mechanics.General Fix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T09:32:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673026","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1841579228671785","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix","summary":"Fixed an issue where the Heal/Buff spell could become stuck when cancelled while charging.Fixed an issue where weather and lighting did not reset correctly when exiting the cave.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T16:38:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671785","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1841579228670803","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"announcement","title":"The Outwith Demo is Now Available","summary":"Hi Folks, After a long time in development, the Outwith demo is now live on Steam!You can now explore the opening section of Outwith, discover the starting village, investigate the surrounding wilderness, and get into a scrape with some ner-do-wells!The demo gives you a first look at the world, combat, exploration, quests and atmosphere that I'm building for the full game.There's still plenty to polish and improve, and I'll be continuing to work on the demo based on player feedback. I'll also be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T05:43:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670803","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1836506165562401","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"announcement","title":"Outwith Steam Playtest Now Live","summary":"Hi folks,I'm excited to announce that the latest Outwith Steam Playtest is now live and available to download!This is by far the biggest and most complete version of Outwith I've shared so far, and I'm really looking forward to hearing what you think.Whether you've been following development for a while or have only just discovered the game, I'd love to hear your feedback. Every comment helps shape the game as I continue working towards the public demo.Development UpdateSince my last update, I'v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T12:52:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562401","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1831432155580188","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"update","title":"Outwith Development Update – Building the World","summary":"Hi folks,Just a quick update on progress.All the major game systems are in place now and have been for a while, so a lot of my focus lately has shifted toward building out content — refining locations, writing dialogue and quests, and shaping the world itself to feel more believable and lived in.The main quest is coming together really nicely, and I’ve also been finalising enemy combat, encounter design, and continuing to polish the overall gameplay experience through regular playtesting and ite","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-05T14:12:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155580188","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3183440-1821288646585996","game_id":"steam-3183440","kind":"announcement","title":"Outwith Playtest Now Open – Looking for Player Feedback","summary":"A new playtest round for Outwith is now live. Use the button on the game store page to register.Please note that this is an early-stage playtest. Many systems are still in development, balance is not final, and bugs are expected. The purpose of this test is not polish — it’s to gather feedback on how the game feels to play. What’s included in this buildThe current playtest includes the starting region in the South East, covering approximately 6-9 km² of the planned 25 km² worldThere are invisibl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-12T14:32:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646585996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3183440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3183440":"2026-10-26T10:16:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3183440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T1